{"id":"en_no-mercy-for-the-protagonist","title":"No Mercy for the Protagonist","titleEn":"No Mercy for the Protagonist","description":"Waking up inside a female-oriented story, he finds himself cast as the pitiful, groveling villain whose fate is an early death. When a mere Foundation-stage cultivator has the nerve to slander someone at the Tribulation Crossing stage, he answers with his Great Wilderness Heaven-binding Finger. His warning is blunt: neglect your cultivation now, and you will end up in his Soul Banner later. Should the Chosen One try to interfere, he threatens to send that entire clan to the afterlife together. And when a foe too strong to beat appears? In this line of work, raw fighting skill is not everything, so he steps back and lets someone else handle the lesson. As a villain, he embraces having no morals and no scheming.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/no-mercy-for-the-protagonist/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/no-mercy-for-the-protagonist/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Cultivation","Fantasy Legends","Time Travel","Male","Multiple Identities","Feel-Good"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcnj6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_no-mercy-for-the-protagonist_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcnj6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_no-mercy-for-the-protagonist_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcnj6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_no-mercy-for-the-protagonist_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.